\* All TLC check configs for AntflyHAGateTransitions.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStaleAllowAfterTransition = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    AllowedWriteRequiresUnfencedPrimary
    MutatingRuntimeRequiresUnfencedPrimary
    Safety

==== BadStaleAllow
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyHAGateTransitions.tla.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStaleAllowAfterTransition = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    AllowedWriteRequiresUnfencedPrimary
    MutatingRuntimeRequiresUnfencedPrimary
